# =====================================================================
# SkyIsland — .gitignore
# Strategy: whitelist-style control. Only real source + the build/gate
# tooling is committed; everything generated or scratch is ignored.
# =====================================================================

# ---- Maven build output ----
target/

# ---- Runtime / capture artifacts ----
logs/
screenshots/

# ---- Build scratch (javac temp dirs, classpath argfiles, ad-hoc work dirs) ----
# 用通配 `.tmp*` 一次覆盖全部临时产物（.tmpclasses/ .tmptestclasses/ .tmptools/
# .tmp_charset.json .tmp_cp.txt .tmp_sources*.txt .tmpall/ 等）。逐个列举的模式会随着
# 临时脚本不断新增而漏掉，而漏掉的那一个会以"未跟踪文件"的身份被 `git add -A` 带进提交。
.tmp*
.toolchain/

# ---- Saved worlds / gate run data (any location) ----
*-saves/

# =====================================================================
# tmp/ — COMMIT ONLY the build & gate tooling; ignore everything else.
#
# CRITICAL TRAP: do NOT write a bare `tmp/` rule here. A trailing-slash
# directory ignore makes the whole subtree unmatchable, so the `!`
# negations further down could never re-include the tooling files.
# `tmp/*` ignores the immediate children only, which lets the explicit
# negations below restore the tooling. (Subsumes the run-data patterns
# `tmp/*.json`, `tmp/*.json.bak`, `tmp/*.log`, `tmp/*.txt`, the save
# dirs (`*-saves/`, `gate-runs/`, `m15-final*/`, `m2gate-*/`), and all
# ad-hoc probes/logs/*.ps1/*.java scratch that accumulate in tmp/.)
# =====================================================================
tmp/*
# --- required tooling, MUST stay tracked ---
!tmp/build.js
!tmp/run_frozen_gate.js
!tmp/run_m2_smoke.js
!tmp/gen_play_bat.js
!tmp/gen_play_m3_bat.js
!tmp/run_gate.js
!tmp/scan_gate.js
# --- PowerShell tooling, MUST stay tracked ---
# WHY: `spawnSync → EBUSY` 发作时，node 发起的任何子进程都会失败，
# `tmp/run_frozen_gate.js` 只能产出 0 字节证据。此时门禁/取证的**唯一可用通道**
# 是 PowerShell 直接 `& java`（见 tmp/run_gate_ps.ps1 文件头）。
# 把它留在 tmp/ 而不跟踪，等于"备用通道只存在于这台机器的磁盘上"——
# 换个克隆就没有了，而届时的症状会是"门禁跑不动、也找不到替代脚本"。
!tmp/run_gate_ps.ps1
!tmp/verify_m3_play.ps1
!tmp/verify_infinite_reserve.ps1
# M4 方块贴图四道守卫 + 统一入口, MUST stay tracked
# WHY: `docs/art/BLOCK_TEXTURE_SPEC.md` 是**美术侧真相源**、`BlockTextures.java` 是实现侧，
# 两者分属不同角色却必须**逐档比对色值**。五脚本里只有 extract_spec.py 直接读规格，
# 另三道都读它产出的 `spec_data.json`，而那是**派生产物、不入库**
# ⇒ 少任何一个，换个克隆就少一道守卫，而症状是"全绿"
# （本轮实测：log_top 误用树皮色阶时 audit_spec 与 verify_grids 都报绿，
#   只有 audit_palette 抓到）。
#
# ★★ 写法陷阱（本项目已踩）：`tmp/*` 忽略的是**直接子项**，
# 所以 `tmp/s3work/` 会被**整体**忽略 —— 一旦如此，
# 它内部的文件就再也匹配不到任何 `!` 规则（git 不会进入被忽略的目录）。
# 之前试过的三种写法全部无效，实测均仍被 `tmp/*` 吞掉：
#   ① `!tmp/s3work/`      → 放行了目录，于是派生产物 spec_data.json 也被放行（更糟：两份真相）
#   ② `!tmp/s3work/*.py`  → 推不翻已忽略的目录
#   ③ 逐文件 `!tmp/s3work/x.py` → 同②
# 正确解法 = **把目录本身从 `tmp/*` 里挖出来**，再在目录内部用
# `tmp/s3work/*` 忽略、逐个 `!` 放行 py（顺序不可颠倒）。
tmp/s3work
!tmp/s3work/
tmp/s3work/*
!tmp/s3work/extract_spec.py
!tmp/s3work/audit_spec.py
!tmp/s3work/verify_grids.py
!tmp/s3work/audit_palette.py
!tmp/s3work/check_all.py
# --- native launcher build script, MUST stay tracked ---
# WHY: `/launcher/*.exe` is ignored below (no 300 KB binary diffs per rebuild),
# so the C source is the ONLY tracked artefact of the Desktop entry point.
# Without a tracked build script, "recompile the launcher" has NO trigger --
# which is exactly how `launcher/SkyIsland.exe` stayed a frozen 09-23 M2.1
# binary for two whole milestones while play-m3.bat was being fixed next to it.
# Guard: NativeLauncherWiringTest#theLauncherHasATrackedBuildScript
!tmp/build_launcher.js

# =====================================================================
# launcher/ — native Windows .exe entry point.
# STRATEGY: track the SOURCE (C launcher, .rc, manifest, icon builder,
# source art), but NOT the compiled binaries or the windres/gcc scratch.
# The .exe is regenerated from source via the same MinGW toolchain; keeping
# it out of git avoids 300KB+ binary diffs on every rebuild.
# =====================================================================
/launcher/*.exe
/launcher/build/

# =====================================================================
# Local tooling — WorkBuddy memory / skills / session data. Never commit;
# it is per-machine state, not project source.
# =====================================================================
.workbuddy/
